window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>All Dr. Eden Mori wanted was to expand her horizons on the galaxy's largest space station, but when the only way to stop a black market sale of dangerous medical schematics is to get close to the data dealer, she's tasked with stopping him.</p> <p>Her partner on this mission? The dealer's estranged, hot-tempered mate. Can she reunite the pair and stop the exchange without getting her heart crushed in the process?</p> <p><i>Space for More</i> is a FFM alien romance filled with seduction, subterfuge, and second chances. No love triangles here—all three get their HEA!</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
